 "text": "Hello, how are things going? It depends on the original gift and what you regift it to. You could donate it to a charity that loves it, or you could use it yourself for few months and then donate it to a thrift. Regifting something someone else bought and wrapped can feel a bit like stealing, so only do it if the original gift was cheap and simple. Some personal care items like shampoo and body creams come in different sizes and you only need a drop at a time. Re Gifting them is kind of cruel.",
